# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets policy (Hybrid — confirmed by founder, 2026-02-10):
#
# 1. backend/.env STAYS ignored. It holds 38 production secrets
#    (STRIPE_API_KEY, JWT_SECRET, AUREM_MASTER_KEY, MONGO_URL, etc).
#    All backend secrets live in the EMERGENT DEPLOYMENT DASHBOARD.
#    The container reads them at runtime from the K8s env.
#
# 2. frontend/.env IS committed via the `!frontend/.env` exception
#    below. It's a build-time file (Vite inlines REACT_APP_*
#    at compile time). Contains zero secrets:
#       - REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL  (the build's default; the dashboard
#         value overrides this for production deploys)
#       - WDS_SOCKET_PORT
#       - ENABLE_HEALTH_CHECK
#    Emergent Support flagged that without this file the production
#    bundle was failing CORS against auremcto.com.
#
# DO NOT remove the .env patterns. DO NOT remove the !frontend/.env
# exception. Both are intentional.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
credentials.json
*.key
.credentials
.env
.env.*
*.env
!frontend/.env

# Iter 212m-179b — repo snapshot cache for search_repo (never commit)
.aurem_cache/
qa/simulated-user/node_modules/@openai/codex-linux-arm64/vendor/aarch64-unknown-linux-musl/bin/codex
qa/simulated-user/node_modules/@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk-linux-arm64/claude
